            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "அவள் பத்து வயது முதல் வீணை கற்றுக்கொள்கிறாள். avaḷ pattu vayatu mutal vīṇai kaṟṟukkoḷkiṟāḷ. She has been learning the veena since she was ten."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A large stringed instrument of South Indian classical music."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
