          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "வீணை (vīṇai) is borrowed from Sanskrit vīṇā, \"a lute\" (CDIAL 12048); Tamil writes the long final vowel as -ஐ."
            }
          ]
        },
