              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): வாசித்தேன், vācittēṉ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Any instrument can take வாசி (vāci); a flute may also take ஊது (ūtu), to blow. It also means \"to read\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
